n Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above." width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner2__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-52061f53></div><div class="landing-feature-banner2__content--standard landing-feature-banner2__content" data-v-52061f53><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner2__title" data-v-52061f53>Middle East Service Update</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner2__rich-text landing-feature-banner2__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner2__rich-text--padding" data-v-52061f53><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a result of the situation in the middle east, international services to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->UAE, Bahrain, Kuwait, Israel, Lebanon and Qatar <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->are facing significant delays. Any shipments in transit to these destinations will be accepted and held until it is clear to send them.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner2__button-wrapper" data-v-52061f53><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner2__button landing-feature-banner2__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/service-status" data-v-52061f53 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Check Service Status<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div></div></section><section id="how-much-does-it-cost-to-send-a-parcel-to-kuwait?" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="3" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>How much does it cost to send a parcel to Kuwait?</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>The price of shipping a parcel to Kuwait depends on its size and weight. See our pricing table below based on some of our most popular weights:</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</th><!----></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>250g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£13.69</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>500g</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£14.09</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>1kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£18.89</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>2kg</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£26.89</span></td><!----></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Weight</span><span data-v-d2116e83>5kg+</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Price</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£47.99</span></td><!----></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__table-footer" data-v-d2116e83><small data-v-d2116e83>Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-d2116e83><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="public-holidays-in-kuwait" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Public holidays in Kuwait</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->While our couriers aim to deliver parcels within 18 to 21 working days, public holidays may cause delays. Consider sending your parcel earlier around these dates to try and get it there on time with your recipient.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Kuwait National Day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 25/02/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Eid al-Fitr<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 20/03/2026 - 21/03/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Arafat<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 25/05/2026 - 26/05/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Eid al-Adha <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 26/05/2026 - 30/05/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Islamic New Year (Al-Hijra)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 16/06/2026 - 17/06/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In addition to national holidays, Kuwait can have other regional and religious holidays to consider that could increase delivery times.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="