><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How can I track my parcel to Kuwait?-open answer" data-test-id="howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How can I track my parcel to Kuwait?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howcanitrackmyparceltokuwait-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your recipient will receive regular updates, and you can both check how far along your par